  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd a post-processor API reference to the user guide.\nDescribe the manifest, hooks, records, properties, helpers, refusals, and standalone debugging commands.\nLink the reference from the posting guide.\nAdd a complete example that produces a text trace.\nRecord the decisions in `docs/decisions/3121-post-processor-reference.md`.\n\nEffort: medium\n\n## Cause\n\nThe posting guide describes the workflow but does not explain the script contract.\nUsers must read developer documents and Rust code to debug their posts.\nThis reference uses only our authoring contract, intermediate-format document, and current implementation.\n\n## Tests\n\nAll three pins failed before the documentation change and pass after it:\n\n- `test_manifest_properties_have_reference_rows`\n- `test_engine_hooks_have_reference_entries`\n- `test_posting_guide_links_to_reference`\n\nEach mutation failed, then passed after restoration:\n\n- Remove the new page, which has no version on upstream/main.\n- Remove the `continuousThreading` reference row.\n- Remove the `onOpen` hook signature.\n- Restore `posting.md` from upstream/main to remove the new link.\n\nThe site builds with Zola 0.23.6, using the release workflow's version and checksum.\nThe full site suite ran 82 tests.\nIt reported 20 existing failures in these four methods:\n\n- `test_first_4axis_part.FirstFourAxisPart.test_each_bold_ui_label_is_a_string_in_its_source`\n- `test_first_continuous_4axis_part.FirstContinuousFourAxisProgram.test_each_bold_ui_label_is_a_string_in_its_source`\n- `test_guide_after_1995.GuideAfter1995.test_ai_chat_pane_is_described_with_its_limits`\n- `test_guide_icons.GuideIcons.test_component_static_icons_and_license_match_app`\n\nThe same failures have identical assertions with the upstream documentation restored.\nThe three new pins pass on the final documentation.\nThe standalone tool runs the documented example with no warnings or stderr.\nIts output matches all four documented lines exactly, including the final newline.\n\nThe required `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` command waited on an orphaned build lock.\nIt stopped after 30 seconds.\nThe fallback passed with `cargo --config 'build.target-dir=\"target-verify\"' xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`.\nCaching was disabled after the initial build stalled in sccache.\nThe quick gate selected zero Rust steps because no crate files changed.\nClippy does not apply because no Rust crate changed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The diff for `*.nc` and `*.cl` is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nNo controller or physical machine was used.\nNo release gate or hardware simulation was run.\nThis change adds documentation and site checks only.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. The file checks found no open PR that changes these paths.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #3121\n",
